- SPOILERS - 









































To rustproof your stuff, read a scroll of enchant weapon/armour while confused
These are the effects:
enchant armour
cursed - nothing happens
uncursed - rustproofs a random peice of armour (so if there is a particular piece of
	armour you want to rustproof, remove everything else)
blessed - Not too sure about this one, but I think it will bless a random piece
	of armour and add bonus to it, or maybe rustproof it ?
There are a lot of pieces of armour which are already rustproofed, such as...
well, that would be telling wouldn't it ?
Things like bronze plate mail don't rust for example, most of them are pretty obvious.

encant weapon
cursed - removes rustproofing
uncursed - rustproofs weapon you are wielding
blessed - again, not too sure, think it blesses the weapon and adds to the bonus,
	maybe rustproof ?

